s.</p><p>The&nbsp;ABMC must seek to enter into a contract with a nonprofit organization to carry out the program during the first 10 fiscal years beginning after the date of enactment of the bill.</p>","updateDate":"2025-07-02T14:20:00Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Fallen Servicemembers Religious Heritage Restoration Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-19T23:27:02Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-19T23:27:02Z"}
